    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000srpu](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000srpu) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 35.0 depth occurred on Jun 09 2026 27km SW of Maasim. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 5.6881 longitude 124.825. It impacted 202579 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
